{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"kind":"article","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Move a playback session between the immersive player and a window without losing the stream."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm"],"title":"Guides","generated":true,"anchor":"Guides"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" belongs to the rendering context it was built for. The context is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed at init through its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SurfaceContext","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": a Compositor Services layer for the fully"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendered immersive player, a RealityKit entity for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VideoPlayerComponent"},{"type":"text","text":" content, or no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context at all for the windowed Metal surface behind "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". None of those can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"follow the viewer into a different scene, so letting someone move a video from an immersive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"space into a window means building a second manager for the new surface."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What that costs you is everything the first manager was holding: the playhead, whether it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"playing, the selected camera, the audio and subtitle languages, and which ad breaks have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"already been seen. The manager cannot carry them across — it is going away — so hold that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"state outside it, and put it back once the new manager is streaming. This guide covers the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hand-over; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the different case of keeping one manager and changing"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the video underneath it."}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The visionOS demo app in "},{"code":"Examples\/visionOS\/DemoApp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implements this end to end:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PlayerCoordinator","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" drives the swap, "},{"code":"PlaybackSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" holds the session across it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PlaybackRestorePoint","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the snapshot below, and "},{"code":"WindowPlayerView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" hosts the windowed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player. The session types live in "},{"code":"Examples\/common","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", shared with the iOS demo."}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Ending the Old Manager Without Ending the Content","anchor":"Ending-the-Old-Manager-Without-Ending-the-Content","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the state you need off the old manager, then tear it down with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/stop(notifyEnded:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"notifyEnded: false"},{"type":"text","text":" so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/isVideoEnded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" stays quiet — the video"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is not over, and a host that dismisses its player UI on that signal would close the scene you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are about to move into:"}]},{"code":["struct SessionState {","    let position: Double","    let isPlaying: Bool","    let cameraId: Int?","    let audioLanguage: String","    let subtitlesLanguage: String","    let playedAdBreakIds: Set<String>","}","","func snapshot(of player: YBVRPlayerManager) -> SessionState {","    SessionState(","        position: player.videoPosition.value,","        isPlaying: player.videoStatus.value != .paused,","        cameraId: player.currentCamera()?.id,","        audioLanguage: player.currentAudioLanguagePublisher.value,","        subtitlesLanguage: player.currentSubtitlesLanguagePublisher.value,","        playedAdBreakIds: player.ads.playedIds.value","    )","}","","pending = snapshot(of: player)","player.stop(notifyEnded: false)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Restoring on the New Manager","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Restoring-on-the-New-Manager"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build the new manager with the surface context for the scene you are moving into, then replay"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the snapshot once "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/startStream(video:_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" has returned:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let player = YBVRPlayerManager(videoConfig: .defaultConfig, surfaceContext: context)","player.ads.markPlayed(pending.playedAdBreakIds)","","try await player.startStream(video: video, signaling)","","if let camera = pending.cameraId.flatMap({ id in player.cameras().first { $0.id == id } }) {","    await player.selectCamera(camera: camera)","}","if pending.position > 0 {","    player.seek(to: CMTimeMakeWithSeconds(pending.position, preferredTimescale: 1000))","}","await player.setAudioLanguage(language: pending.audioLanguage)","await player.setSubtitlesLanguage(language: pending.subtitlesLanguage)","","pending.isPlaying ? player.play() : player.pause()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Seek once the stream is actually ready — waiting for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/videoStatus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ready"},{"type":"text","text":" is enough — or the seek lands on an item that has no seekable range yet."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Live content without time shifting cannot be resumed at a position; check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Video\/isTimeShiftingAllowed","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" before restoring one, and let the new player join at the live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge otherwise."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Ads-Across-the-Swap","text":"Ads Across the Swap"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/markPlayed(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" is the one restore step that has to happen ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"text":" the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"new manager opens its stream, so call it as soon as the manager exists.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two things go wrong without it. A pre-roll is armed at position zero on the fresh manager and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plays again the moment content starts. And the restore seek jumps forward over any mid-roll"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the viewer has already watched, which is indistinguishable from someone skipping over one —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playsMissedMidRollsOnSeek","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" re-arms it and it plays a second time."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Marking the ids from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playedIds","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" drops those breaks from the schedule and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes them out of the catch-up."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The schedule itself does not survive either: hand the new manager its breaks with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/schedule(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the same way you did the first one. Order does not matter —"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"marking before or after scheduling both work, and so does marking before the stream opens."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Surfaces Draw Different Things","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Surfaces-Draw-Different-Things"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not every surface renders the same overlays, so what your UI has to supply changes with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode. Ask the manager rather than assuming:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/surfaceRendersSubtitles","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" for the immersive Compositor"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Services renderer, which burns cues into the video. On the windowed and RealityKit surfaces"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":", and the cue from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/currentSubtitleCue","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is yours to place."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/surfaceRendersControlRoomMiniScreens","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/showCRMiniScreens(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/hitTestCRMiniScreen(rayDirection:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" do anything. Where it is "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build the mini screens from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ControlRoomView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Re-binding-Your-Subscriptions","text":"Re-binding Your Subscriptions"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every publisher you were observing belonged to the old manager. Cancel those subscriptions as"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"part of the swap and re-subscribe to the new manager, exactly as you would around a content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"switch. Anything you cached — the surface controller from"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/getSurfaceController()"},{"text":", a control room view model, a renderer — has to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"be re-read too.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A counter that increments on every swap makes this easy to drive from SwiftUI: observe it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and rebuild your bindings whenever it changes."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/switchingplayermode"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode"},"metadata":{"title":"Switching Player Mode","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/AdInsertion":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Schedule ad breaks against the content timeline and drive your own ad UI."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/adinsertion","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","title":"Inserting Ads","role":"article"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/surfaceRendersControlRoomMiniScreens":{"title":"surfaceRendersControlRoomMiniScreens","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"surfaceRendersControlRoomMiniScreens","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/surfacerenderscontrolroomminiscreens","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/surfaceRendersControlRoomMiniScreens","role":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/controlroomselectorviewmodel()","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"controlRoomSelectorViewModel"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12YBVRAppleSDK28ControlRoomSelectorViewModelC","text":"ControlRoomSelectorViewModel"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"type":"topic","title":"controlRoomSelectorViewModel()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/ControlRoomView":{"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/controlroomview","abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ControlRoomView","role":"symbol","title":"ControlRoomView","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ControlRoomView","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ControlRoomView","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"YBVRPlayerManager"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"YBVRPlayer is an object that provides the interface to display videos inside custom geometries."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"YBVRPlayerManager"}],"type":"topic","title":"YBVRPlayerManager","kind":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/SurfaceContext":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/surfacecontext","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SurfaceContext","role":"symbol","title":"SurfaceContext","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SurfaceContext","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SurfaceContext"}]},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/startStream(video:_:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/startstream(video:_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/startStream(video:_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Opens "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"video"},{"type":"text","text":" and starts playing it."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"startStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"video"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12YBVRAppleSDK5VideoV","text":"Video"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12YBVRAppleSDK18SignalingInterfaceP","text":"SignalingInterface"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"type":"topic","title":"startStream(video:_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/showCRMiniScreens(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/showcrminiscreens(_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"showCRMiniScreens","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"showCRMiniScreens(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/showCRMiniScreens(_:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRAdController/markPlayed(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvradcontroller\/markplayed(_:)","abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/markPlayed(_:)","role":"symbol","title":"markPlayed(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"markPlayed"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}]},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/ContentSwitching":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/contentswitching","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Move an existing player from one video to another without tearing it down."}],"type":"topic","title":"Switching Content","kind":"article"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRAdController/schedule(_:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvradcontroller\/schedule(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/schedule(_:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"schedule"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12YBVRAppleSDK11YBVRAdBreakV","text":"YBVRAdBreak"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"type":"topic","title":"schedule(_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/GeometryVideoView":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/geometryvideoview","title":"GeometryVideoView","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GeometryVideoView"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GeometryVideoView","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRAdController/playedIds":{"title":"playedIds","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"playedIds"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Combine19CurrentValueSubjectC","text":"CurrentValueSubject"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5NeverO","text":"Never"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvradcontroller\/playedids","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playedIds","role":"symbol"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/Drm":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where encrypted content plays, where it cannot, and how the SDK decides which it is."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/drm","type":"topic","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm","role":"article","title":"FairPlay DRM"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/surfaceRendersSubtitles":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"surfaceRendersSubtitles","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[],"title":"surfaceRendersSubtitles","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/surfaceRendersSubtitles","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/surfacerenderssubtitles"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/videoStatus":{"title":"videoStatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Current video status. Can be "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ready"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"paused"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"buffering"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"videoStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Combine19CurrentValueSubjectC","text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12YBVRAppleSDK11VideoStatusO","text":"VideoStatus","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"t